1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,379
Welcome!

2
00:00:02,319 --> 00:00:06,313
In this short video, you'll learn how to buy USDT with MoonPay,

3
00:00:06,253 --> 00:00:10,197
and send it straight to the wallet address we gave you.

4
00:00:10,137 --> 00:00:14,539
It only takes a few minutes, and no crypto experience is needed.

5
00:00:15,659 --> 00:00:17,844
First, what is USDT?

6
00:00:17,784 --> 00:00:21,894
USDT, also known as Tether, is a stablecoin.

7
00:00:21,834 --> 00:00:25,260
Its value is designed to stay close to one US dollar,

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,948
so its price doesn't jump up and down like Bitcoin.

9
00:00:28,888 --> 00:00:30,879
That's why it's a simple, fast,

10
00:00:30,819 --> 00:00:34,077
and popular way to send payments worldwide.

11
00:00:35,297 --> 00:00:38,312
Before you start, make sure you have four things.

12
00:00:38,252 --> 00:00:40,115
A smartphone or a computer,

13
00:00:40,055 --> 00:00:44,050
a valid ID, such as a passport or a national ID card,

14
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:48,620
a payment method, like a bank card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, or PayPal,

15
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,812
and the wallet address we sent you.

16
00:00:52,032 --> 00:00:54,733
Step one: open your MoonPay account.

17
00:00:54,673 --> 00:00:59,139
Go to moonpay.com, or download the official MoonPay app.

18
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:02,148
Tap Sign up, and enter your email address.

19
00:01:02,088 --> 00:01:05,810
Then enter the code that MoonPay sends to your email.

20
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:09,596
Step two: verify your identity.

21
00:01:09,536 --> 00:01:11,661
You only need to do this once.

22
00:01:11,601 --> 00:01:16,338
Add a few personal details, like your name, date of birth, and address.

23
00:01:16,278 --> 00:01:19,766
Then take a photo of your ID, and a quick selfie.

24
00:01:19,706 --> 00:01:22,682
Approval usually takes just a few minutes.

25
00:01:23,902 --> 00:01:26,006
Step three: choose what to buy.

26
00:01:25,946 --> 00:01:29,591
Open the crypto list, and search for USDT.

27
00:01:29,531 --> 00:01:32,079
Now the most important part:

28
00:01:32,019 --> 00:01:38,126
choose USDT on the BNB Smart Chain network, also called BEP-20.

29
00:01:38,066 --> 00:01:40,582
Then enter the amount you want to spend.

30
00:01:40,522 --> 00:01:44,157
MoonPay shows how much USDT you'll receive.

31
00:01:45,377 --> 00:01:47,858
Step four: enter the wallet address.

32
00:01:47,798 --> 00:01:49,520
Copy the address we sent you,

33
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:52,435
and paste it into the wallet address field.

34
00:01:52,375 --> 00:01:54,139
Never type it by hand.

35
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,907
Check that it starts with 0x,

36
00:01:55,847 --> 00:01:59,344
and that the first and last few characters match.

37
00:01:59,284 --> 00:02:03,072
If MoonPay offers to create a new wallet for you, don't.

38
00:02:03,012 --> 00:02:05,426
Always use the address we gave you.

39
00:02:06,646 --> 00:02:08,292
Step five: pay.

40
00:02:08,232 --> 00:02:11,996
Choose your card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, or PayPal.

41
00:02:11,936 --> 00:02:14,266
Review your order: the amount, the fees,

42
00:02:14,206 --> 00:02:16,609
the network, and the wallet address.

43
00:02:16,549 --> 00:02:18,220
Then tap Confirm.

44
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,788
If your card is declined,

45
00:02:19,728 --> 00:02:24,441
add money to your MoonPay Balance first, and buy from your balance.

46
00:02:24,381 --> 00:02:25,515
That's it!

47
00:02:25,455 --> 00:02:30,789
Your USDT is sent straight to our address, usually within a few minutes.

48
00:02:32,009 --> 00:02:34,415
Finally, a few safety tips.

49
00:02:34,355 --> 00:02:37,547
Only use the official MoonPay website or app.

50
00:02:37,487 --> 00:02:39,454
Fake sites do exist.

51
00:02:39,394 --> 00:02:42,097
Always use the latest address we sent you.

52
00:02:42,037 --> 00:02:44,846
We may give you a new address for each payment.

53
00:02:44,786 --> 00:02:48,199
Double-check the network and the address before you pay.

54
00:02:48,139 --> 00:02:51,594
And never share your passwords or codes with anyone.

55
00:02:52,814 --> 00:02:54,292
Let's recap.

56
00:02:54,232 --> 00:02:57,401
Open your account, verify your identity,

57
00:02:57,341 --> 00:03:02,980
choose USDT on BNB Smart Chain, paste our wallet address, and pay.

58
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,490
Thanks for watching!

59
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:07,819
If you have any questions, just send us a message.

